	(1162,'I would create some surreptitious means to keep my brother out of the order.  I can keep him out without him being any bit wiser, thereby saving our familial bonds.'),
	(1163,'I would show my liege the beast\'s ear and claim the beast\'s death as my own, taking the reward for my own use.  It is wrong to claim a deed as your own that someone else in fact did.'),
