	(1229,'Admiral, I need another tree disguise kit.'),
	(1230,'We have much in common, night elf. I can\'t help but feel that perhaps it was fate that brought us together. Let me help you, Cowlen. Let my people help. We will right the wrongs. This I vow.'),
	(1231,'I fear that my people are somewhat responsible for this destruction. We are refugees, displaced from our homes by the Burning Legion. This tragedy is a result of our latest evacuation. Our vessel crashed - this debris is a part of that vessel.'),
