	(1257,'Nobundo, please continue.'),
	(1258,'What did it say to you?'),
	(1259,'What was that?'),
	(1260,'What did you do then?'),
	(1261,'Please, go on.'),
	(1262,'I wish to train, Aesom.'),
	(1263,'I\'m a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events.'),
	(1264,'I did and you believed me. Thank you for the information, blood elf. You have helped us more than you could know.'),
	(1265,'The Vector Coil is massive. I hope we have more than one abomination guarding the numerous weak points.'),
	(1266,'Sironas is an eredar... I mean, yes, obviously.'),
	(1267,'Incredible. How did Sironas accomplish such a thing?'),
	(1268,'Ah yes, Sironas. I had nearly forgotten that Sironas was here. I served under Sironas back on Outland. I hadn\'t heard of this abomination, though; those damnable draenei captured me before I even fully materialized on this world.'),
	(1269,'Naturalist, please grant me your boon.'),
